+- **Lockfile Integrity (SHA-512)**: `sha512-HUDlfsrYH6ko5xH56L62Mcl/uzT+AGVNMHFuDNqDJMdZWc1AQa2oeVKNUvZ/RWBZQ4TYtyQerFrNvLnp39h65A==`
